{"title": "Single Utility Scroll Supply Table", "pageid": 14547, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Single_Utility_Scroll_Supply_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Single Utility Scroll Supply Table</b>, also known as <code>Supply_Scroll_Utility_Single</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Scroll_Utility_Single+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Scroll_Utility_Single+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains utility <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">Scrolls</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Single Utility Scroll Supply Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 1 - 3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Scrolls\" title=\"Utility Scrolls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png/40px-Scroll_Utility.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png/60px-Scroll_Utility.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sc